{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","加拉哈德"],["/names/en","Galahad"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名智慧善良的法师，能够使用多种复杂的魔法进行战斗。"],["/description_i18n/en","A wise and kind-hearted Mage who wields a wide range of powerful spells."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","终于能和您并肩作战了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll be at your side."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","离您更近了一步。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I'm one step closer."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","时间——请为我停驻。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Time stops... at my behest!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","对不起，没能帮上您……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","I've failed you..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","您会为我骄傲吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Did I make you proud?"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","终于……与您重逢"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","We're together... once again."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我会为您而战。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","I will fight for you."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","您送我的手帕……我一直小心珍藏着呢。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","That piece of cloth you gave me... I've always kept it."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","愿魔法的辉光，能够惠及众生。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/en","The light of magic is meant for all of us."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","谢谢您，我会好好珍惜的。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Thank you. I'll cherish this."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","您总是这样体贴。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","You're always so considerate."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","悠古神巫"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Daughter of Dawn"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","我会为自己而活，成为让您骄傲的人。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","I'll live on my own terms and become someone you'd be proud of."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","丛林晨露"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Forest Dew"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","于黎明的晨雾和露水之间漫步。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Wander through the misty haze, where golden dawn meets dew."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“预兆之路”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Complete Story Quest - Fateful Path"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","原来也有这样风味的食物"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","So there are foods that taste like this."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这就是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人生活的地方……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This is where Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> lives..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","是否能向他人请教魔法呢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Can I ask others about magic here?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","随着狩猎神的陨落，雅库伯尔巫祭的地位一落千丈。但在戈丹去世后，加拉以大祭司的身份率领雅库伯尔开启了新的篇章。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","The fall of the Hunting Goddess brought about the swift decline of the Wildborn priesthood. But after Kordan's death, Gala was raised as the new high priestess and led her people into a new era."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","尽管时常跟随魔法师协会外出游历，加拉在雅库伯尔依然具有极高的声望，地位更是无可动摇。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Despite her frequent absences, traveling with the Arcane Council, Gala's standing among the Wildborn remained undiminished and unshakable."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","很少有人知道，加拉其实非常善于跳舞，尤其是用来祭祀和取悦神明的舞蹈。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Few knew the truth. Gala was a sublime dancer. Her movements were honed for sacred rites meant to appease the gods."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","每当加拉感到迷茫、无措或沮丧时，她都会下意识地抚上颈间的手帕，只因它永远能给她无限的力量。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","In moments of doubt, confusion, or despair, Gala's hand would drift unconsciously to the piece of cloth at her neck. A simple touch that always fills her with strength and comfort... like a child holding her favorite teddy bear."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","随着加拉的成长，她在与摩根的辩论中也逐渐占了上风，初代梅林对此非常欣慰。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Merlin the First took immense joy in watching Gala grow to become Morgan's equal, and then his superior, in debate. For his part, Morgan secretly loved being challenged but always expressed mock exasperation."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","加拉利用所学的魔药知识发明了一种使毛发柔顺的方法，深受雅库伯尔人的喜爱。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Gala used her knowledge of potions to invent a solution that makes hair and fur smooth and supple. It became a hit among the Wildborn. She's thinking about calling the liquid \"hairdoo\"."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","仰仗加拉高超的外交手腕，雅库伯尔与周围许多城邦和部落都建立了友好的关系，其中包括阿邦德领导的呼临城。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","It was due to Gala's diplomatic skills that the Wildborn was able to establish friendly relations with the surrounding city-states, including Halia, led by Abundius. He still remembers her from when they were young."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","加拉对待孩子格外有耐心，特别是那些沉默寡言的孩子，她总是愿意聆听他们磕磕绊绊的表述，安抚他们敏感的内心。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Gala possessed a rare patience for children, especially the quiet ones. She had a gift for listening to their halting, stumbling words and soothing their sensitive hearts."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","即使在狩猎神陨落后，每当血月降临，加拉也都会来到悬天河祭坛等上一整晚。所有雅库伯尔人都说，她是在等待她信仰的人再次归来。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Even after the Hunting Goddess' fall, Gala would return to the Skyfall Altar with every blood moon, looking at her guardian leaf all night. The Wildborn believed she was waiting for the one she had faith in to return to her."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","无论离开多远多久，加拉都会在小麦丰收的时候回到雅库伯尔，亲手摘下第一捧麦穗。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","No matter how far or how long she was away, Gala would always return to the tribe when harvesting season arrived to personally pick the first ear of wheat."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","狩猎神大人，请收下贡品。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Herdmaster, may this offering please you."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","如果狩猎神大人想四处走走，加拉可以陪伴您。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","If you'd like to look around, I'd be honored to be your guide."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411030.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411030.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","乌云低压。该让蒙多做一次占卜。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","The sky looks heavy today. Maybe Modra should read the signs again."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411040.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411040.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","戈丹 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Kordan & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人，您有使魔吗？"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, do you have any familiars?"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411050.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411050.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","很简单。向前任首领发起决斗，然后胜过他。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Easy. You just challenge the last chief and win the duel."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411060.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411060.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","戈丹 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Kordan & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","我的魔法，和受到神赐的巫祭很像。那么狩猎神赐予的，也是魔法吗？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","My magic feels a lot like the priestesses'. Think that means it came from the Hunting Goddess too?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411080.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411080.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人，为什么一直盯着加拉的尾巴看？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, why do you keep staring at my tail?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411090.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411090.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","梅林，拿着的是什么？"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Merlin, what's that in your hand?"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411100.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411100.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 初代梅林"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Merlin the First"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","有点吵……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","It's kinda noisy..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 初代梅林"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Merlin the First"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","小家伙，别这样直勾勾地盯着别人。我不觉得我脸上有什么值得在意的东西。"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Hey, kid. Quit staring. There's nothing special about my face, trust me."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411150.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411150.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","摩根 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Morgan & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","这片高原的土地好干涸。"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","This plateau is bone dry."],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411170.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411170.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 初代梅林"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Merlin the First"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","呼临人手里，拿着很多褐色的圆片。"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","They've all got these little brown discs in their hands."],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411190.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411190.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 初代梅林"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Merlin the First"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","蒙受丰饶神神恩的图塔镇已化作一片废墟，如今的呼临也饿殍遍地，民不聊生。"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Tuttleton was the first to collapse after the God of Harvest's fall. Now it's just rubble. Halia's still standing, but barely. Folks are starving. The city's hanging on by a thread."],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411200.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411200.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","初代梅林 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Merlin the First & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","那非，你在研究什么？"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Nazrik, what are you studying?"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411210.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411210.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Nazrik"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人，魔法应该怎么练习？"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, what's the right way to train magic?"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411220.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411220.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","……不要一直盯着我的尾巴。"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","... Stop staring at my tails."],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411230.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411230.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Nazrik & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","你很珍视你的矛。"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","You really care about that spear of yours."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411240.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411240.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Nazrik"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","逐影营地的长老，都罗，他多大了？"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","How old is Toro, the elder of Veilwatch Camp?"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep5/herohub_story/15411250.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/ep5/herohub_story/15411250.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德 & 那非"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Galahad & Nazrik"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","与堕神的决战竟然这么艰险……真是难以想象！"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","The battle against the fallen goddess must've been so harrowing! I would've been so scared!"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415704.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415704.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Galahad"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","原来也有这样风味的食物"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/en","So there are foods that taste like this."],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415713.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415713.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/en","Galahad"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/cn","这就是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人生活的地方……"],["/interaction_records/20/preview_i18n/en","This is where Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> lives..."],["/interaction_records/20/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415714.json"],["/interaction_records/20/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415714.json"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/cn","加拉哈德"],["/interaction_records/20/title_i18n/en","Galahad"]]}